
= Forth for TIC-80 =

A port of the Forth language (based on pforth) as a scripting language for
TIC-80, the fantasy console for making, playing and sharing tiny retro
games. Adds Forth to the list of available cartridge languages, alongside
Lua, JavaScript, Ruby, and others.

